flowchart LR
    U([Pet owner]) -->|adds pet: species, age, special needs| UI[Streamlit UI - app.py]

    subgraph RAG [AI care assistant - care_assistant.py]
        R[Retriever: picks matching notes] --> KB[(knowledge/ pet-care notes)]
        KB --> R
        R -->|retrieved notes + pet info| LLM[Claude API]
        LLM -->|suggested tasks as JSON| G[Guardrails: validate priority, duration, category]
    end

    UI -->|request suggestions| R
    G -->|valid tasks| UI
    G -.->|rejected / API error| LOG[(logs/pawpal.log)]
    R -.-> LOG
    LLM -.-> LOG

    UI -->|owner approves tasks| CORE
    subgraph CORE [Logic layer - pawpal_system.py]
        O[Owner] --> P[Pet] --> T[Task]
        O --> S[Scheduler: sort, assign slots, detect conflicts, explain]
    end

    S -->|daily plan + warnings| UI
    UI -->|shows schedule| U
    TESTS[pytest - tests/] -.->|verifies| CORE
    TESTS -.->|verifies| G
    